				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The formal verification of the current O player strategies shows that the O player loses in the following given situation that we'll call *\"corner-opossite-corner\" fork."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-24T12:00:35.079886+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-24T12:02:28.735996+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "YUtUWkb+DQCPcbUtBGI9OA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "When the first two Xs are marked in two opposite corners and the first O is marked at the center square, there is an immediate threat for 2 different forks because the next X move could be any of the two free corners, and so creating a fork situation."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-24T12:02:36.623529+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-24T12:03:57.59168+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "RGjWYkb+DQCS0onlBGI9OA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The following board shows the described pattern:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
